# Copy to .env.local (never commit real values). Vite auto-loads this
# file itself (no dotenv needed here) and only exposes VITE_-prefixed
# vars to client code — see src/vite-env.d.ts. These two URLs come from
# `cdk deploy`'s printed CfnOutputs (HttpApiUrl, WebSocketUrl) after a
# real deploy — see the repo root's .env.example for everything else
# AWS-related (credentials, table names, which services are required).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://changeme.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
VITE_WEBSOCKET_URL=wss://changeme.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/prod
# Decorative today, not actually enforced server-side (07-EDGE-CASES.md
# edge case E-1, a stated known limitation) — any non-empty value works.
VITE_API_KEY=changeme
